WEBVTT

00:41.750 --> 00:44.210
LEE JU-HUN REVEALS TRUTH
ABOUT JEONG SE-YEON'S DEATH

00:59.309 --> 01:00.226
Soo-ho.

01:07.776 --> 01:09.235
BASED ON WEBTOON TRUE BEAUTY
BY YAONGYI

01:10.904 --> 01:12.030
It's Ju-kyung, again.

01:13.364 --> 01:14.199
Yes.

01:22.123 --> 01:23.124
It's me again.

01:24.793 --> 01:26.211
I missed you.

01:30.298 --> 01:31.508
And you're here.

01:34.260 --> 01:36.012
I came to give you a hug.

02:59.387 --> 03:01.139
Are you doing okay?

03:02.932 --> 03:05.476
I have almost no memories with my dad.

03:06.269 --> 03:07.687
After my mom passed away,

03:08.980 --> 03:10.773
my dad was mostly in the States.

03:12.859 --> 03:14.777
I lived with my grandma on my mom's side,

03:16.195 --> 03:18.281
then started living alone
in middle school.

03:20.658 --> 03:22.118
It must have been tough.

03:24.913 --> 03:26.414
I hated him for so long.

03:28.958 --> 03:32.128
I poured out everything…

03:34.047 --> 03:35.632
I'd pressed down deep inside,

03:37.550 --> 03:39.385
thinking it might make my heart lighter,

03:40.720 --> 03:42.222
but it still feels heavy.

03:57.737 --> 03:59.697
Is this because I haven't forgiven him?

04:01.074 --> 04:02.909
Or am I feeling sorry for him?

04:04.786 --> 04:05.954
I'm not even quite sure…

04:09.582 --> 04:10.959
how I'm feeling right now.

04:29.978 --> 04:30.979
You did what?

04:31.562 --> 04:32.814
Running out without a word?

04:32.897 --> 04:34.607
Honey, calm down and use your words.

04:34.691 --> 04:36.359
Are you out of your mind?

04:36.901 --> 04:39.904
Don't you get how important
this period is for you?

04:41.823 --> 04:42.949
How dare you?

04:43.658 --> 04:44.951
Don't glare at me like that!

04:47.745 --> 04:51.082
- You little…
- Honey, hold on.

04:51.165 --> 04:52.083
Honey!

04:52.583 --> 04:53.626
Calm down!

04:57.547 --> 04:59.924
What are you doing right now?
Open the door!

05:00.008 --> 05:03.011
I'll talk to her, so stop it!

05:03.094 --> 05:03.970
Open the door!

05:31.247 --> 05:33.958
Mr. Kang, how's the company?

05:34.042 --> 05:35.043
It's out of control.

05:35.668 --> 05:38.796
There are hordes of reporters
and Black Soul fans out front.

05:38.880 --> 05:40.506
The loss and damages are huge.

05:41.007 --> 05:42.633
Mr. Lee must not be himself either.

06:00.735 --> 06:03.696
"STARLIGHT"

06:52.829 --> 06:53.830
Hey.

06:56.499 --> 06:57.333
Here.

06:59.710 --> 07:01.003
It's gotten all loose.

07:02.880 --> 07:04.757
Your cone looks slanted.

07:04.841 --> 07:05.925
Try this one on then.

07:12.014 --> 07:13.683
Lee Soo-ho, Han Seo-jun.

07:13.766 --> 07:15.351
- How does it look?
- Not bad.

07:15.435 --> 07:18.187
This stuff makes me cringe,
so I wasn't going to write it.

07:19.689 --> 07:21.441
But during my acceptance speech,

07:21.524 --> 07:23.693
I was busy crying,
so I didn't get to thank you.

07:25.445 --> 07:26.737
I'm doing this so you won't sulk.

07:32.118 --> 07:34.328
My life was like winter
until you two came along.

07:35.204 --> 07:36.080
Thanks to you two,

07:38.040 --> 07:40.042
the past three years have been very warm.

07:41.669 --> 07:43.713
During those warm days,

07:43.796 --> 07:44.630
I laughed a lot,

07:46.340 --> 07:47.592
I regained my confidence,

07:49.844 --> 07:51.471
and I was able to achieve my dream.

08:02.398 --> 08:04.025
The brightest day of my life,

08:06.152 --> 08:07.862
this moment with you today,

08:09.447 --> 08:10.740
I'll remember it forever.

08:15.620 --> 08:17.038
My dear friends,

08:19.081 --> 08:20.041
I love you.

08:23.002 --> 08:24.962
The moment you read this mushy letter,

08:25.046 --> 08:26.422
I'll regret ever writing it.

08:27.423 --> 08:29.258
Here's hoping you'll never find it.

08:30.801 --> 08:31.719
Se-yeon.

08:51.739 --> 08:53.574
Do you remember what he said
when we bought these?

08:54.825 --> 08:56.118
"Let's be together forever"?

08:56.202 --> 08:57.662
I called it childish.

09:00.081 --> 09:01.082
Yes, you did.

09:02.083 --> 09:03.793
Being together was a given back then.

09:05.378 --> 09:07.505
I thought we'd be together forever.

09:09.632 --> 09:12.385
Who knew that forever would be this short?

09:14.095 --> 09:15.012
Right.

09:16.264 --> 09:17.557
It was too short.

09:18.432 --> 09:20.268
Leaving him alone when he was struggling

09:21.227 --> 09:23.271
is something I regret
and feel terrible about.

09:24.897 --> 09:26.190
And now he's gone.

09:27.817 --> 09:30.444
So blaming you and cursing at you…

09:32.530 --> 09:33.781
were my ways of coping.

09:36.742 --> 09:37.994
I focused only on my pain,

09:39.287 --> 09:40.496
and I didn't notice yours.

09:44.208 --> 09:45.334
I'm sorry.

09:52.049 --> 09:53.259
What's wrong with us?

10:04.020 --> 10:06.272
MISSED CALL
DAD

10:11.068 --> 10:12.445
How's your dad?

10:13.279 --> 10:14.447
Who knows.

10:15.990 --> 10:18.242
I used to be so jealous
of you having a rich dad,

10:19.118 --> 10:20.536
but now I'm not jealous at all.

10:21.203 --> 10:23.623
What's there to be jealous of?
You have your mom.

10:24.540 --> 10:25.916
This isn't a pity competition.

10:26.834 --> 10:28.210
Your family's rich!

10:29.462 --> 10:30.713
Are we still?

10:30.796 --> 10:34.383
People say rich people can eat
all three meals even after going bankrupt.

10:34.467 --> 10:36.802
It's three generations, dummy.

10:36.886 --> 10:37.803
What?

10:37.887 --> 10:39.472
You really don't know anything.

10:40.514 --> 10:43.059
Who throws a cigarette butt at people?

10:44.477 --> 10:46.562
Who do you mean? Me?

10:50.650 --> 10:52.985
You just threw a cigarette butt at us!

10:53.069 --> 10:54.779
What are you? Some gangsters?

10:54.862 --> 10:56.822
This boy called us gangsters.

10:56.906 --> 10:58.658
- What?
- What?

10:58.741 --> 11:01.160
- Who did?
- Who the heck are you?

11:01.243 --> 11:02.536
- What is it?
- Hey.

11:03.245 --> 11:04.330
What?

11:04.413 --> 11:06.332
Come here, boy.

11:07.541 --> 11:08.584
Look at that.

11:09.752 --> 11:11.128
Hold back, okay?

11:11.212 --> 11:12.296
Hey.

11:12.380 --> 11:13.381
Let's run.

11:14.924 --> 11:17.051
- Hey!
- Catch him.

11:17.134 --> 11:19.345
- Boys, come here!
- Hey, you two!

11:19.428 --> 11:21.972
Running like that won't help!

11:25.059 --> 11:27.395
- You threw a crutch at us?
- Hey!

11:27.478 --> 11:30.189
- Get them!
- You bastard! Come here!

11:30.272 --> 11:31.440
Come here!

11:32.483 --> 11:33.651
- Hey!
- Stop right there!

11:33.734 --> 11:35.778
- Stop!
- Come here!

11:37.071 --> 11:39.198
- Get them!
- Come here!

11:39.281 --> 11:40.366
Get them!

11:41.617 --> 11:42.451
Hey, grab them!

11:47.289 --> 11:49.708
- Get them!
- Grab them!

11:51.585 --> 11:52.753
Hey!

12:00.761 --> 12:01.804
What's this smell?

12:02.471 --> 12:03.639
Jeez.

12:03.722 --> 12:05.516
- Hey, let me see.
- What's this?

12:05.599 --> 12:07.226
They jumped into a pile of turds.

12:07.810 --> 12:09.228
What did they use for manure?

12:09.311 --> 12:11.397
Consider yourselves lucky, okay?

12:11.981 --> 12:13.524
- Let's go, guys.
- Yes, sir.

12:17.069 --> 12:18.237
- Turds?
- Jeez.

12:18.821 --> 12:21.031
- Can't you control your temper?
- How could I have known?

12:22.074 --> 12:23.909
I even gave you a piggyback ride.

12:24.827 --> 12:25.828
Hey, my feet hurt.

12:26.579 --> 12:27.538
The smell…

12:29.415 --> 12:31.167
Stay away, jeez.

12:42.094 --> 12:44.263
I wish Ju-kyung could see you right now.

12:45.139 --> 12:46.599
You think she'd be disappointed?

12:47.349 --> 12:49.018
That wouldn't make her fall for you.

12:49.685 --> 12:52.521
What makes you say that?
Why are you so conscious of me?

12:52.605 --> 12:53.522
How could I not be?

12:54.064 --> 12:55.107
Are you over her yet?

12:55.691 --> 12:56.692
It's not easy.

12:57.526 --> 12:58.527
Then,

12:58.611 --> 13:00.446
are you going to tell her how you feel?

13:00.529 --> 13:02.239
No way! She's dating you!

13:02.990 --> 13:03.949
Get over her already.

13:04.700 --> 13:05.910
It's not that easy.

13:05.993 --> 13:07.536
What are you playing at then?

13:07.620 --> 13:09.747
I don't know. Stay away! Scoot over.

13:09.830 --> 13:11.749
- Don't touch me.
- I didn't touch you.

13:12.333 --> 13:14.335
You have poop all over your face now.

13:14.418 --> 13:15.336
The smell…

13:15.419 --> 13:16.629
I can say the same, okay?

13:21.634 --> 13:23.636
2ND ASSIGNMENT
CLASSIC ICON MAKEUP

13:27.348 --> 13:28.641
Are you finally registering?

13:28.724 --> 13:30.935
Yes, I got my pay
from my part-time job today.

13:31.018 --> 13:33.521
Is our Limju going to be
the next Selena then?

13:33.604 --> 13:35.189
MY FRIEND SU-AH

14:06.595 --> 14:07.763
Hello.

14:07.846 --> 14:09.390
I'd like to register for a course.

14:09.473 --> 14:11.100
Okay. Please fill out this form.

14:14.853 --> 14:17.982
COURSE REGISTRATION AGREEMENT
LIM JU-KYUNG

14:29.952 --> 14:31.620
Don't spill food when you eat.

14:35.875 --> 14:37.042
- Add the rice?
- Yes.

14:47.219 --> 14:48.262
That was great.

14:48.345 --> 14:49.889
Soo-ho, get me some water.

14:58.564 --> 14:59.732
It's my phone, okay?

15:00.816 --> 15:02.610
Are you showing off that you're dating?

15:07.031 --> 15:08.073
Did you two make up?

15:09.325 --> 15:10.659
I told you to stay out of it.

15:10.743 --> 15:11.869
How could I not?

15:11.952 --> 15:15.039
Didn't you two fight because
people thought she and I were dating?

15:15.122 --> 15:15.998
You're so petty.

15:17.666 --> 15:20.377
But don't you think
she has a reason she can't tell people

15:20.920 --> 15:22.087
about you two dating?

15:22.171 --> 15:23.297
What reason?

15:25.633 --> 15:27.551
Su-jin seemed to be that reason.

15:28.260 --> 15:29.261
Su-jin?

15:31.096 --> 15:34.183
How are you dating her
when you're this clueless?

15:35.351 --> 15:36.769
Lately, I've begun

15:36.852 --> 15:37.978
to care about you.

15:40.481 --> 15:41.774
GIRLFRIEND

15:56.872 --> 15:57.706
Hey, it's me…

15:59.375 --> 16:00.918
Don't laugh.

16:01.001 --> 16:02.294
Did you have a good day?

16:02.378 --> 16:03.796
I almost had a good day.

16:03.879 --> 16:05.756
The last part was very unexpected.

16:05.839 --> 16:08.425
What? Why? What happened?

16:08.509 --> 16:09.718
I fell into a pile of turds.

16:10.928 --> 16:12.554
You know how to joke around, I see.

16:12.638 --> 16:13.889
How's your leg?

16:13.973 --> 16:15.641
Wasn't it difficult using a crutch?

16:15.724 --> 16:17.643
The doctor said not to overexert yourself.

16:17.726 --> 16:20.229
I looked it up.
Bananas, spinach, safflower seeds,

16:20.312 --> 16:22.564
broccoli, and oranges are good for bones.

16:22.648 --> 16:24.316
Remember that and make sure to eat them.

16:24.400 --> 16:26.235
Bananas, spinach, safflower seeds…

16:28.028 --> 16:30.489
- Why are you smiling?
- It's nice to hear you fuss.

16:30.572 --> 16:31.991
Please continue.

16:32.074 --> 16:34.284
Gosh, come on.

16:35.369 --> 16:37.621
Oh, right. I have something for you.

16:38.163 --> 16:38.998
What is it?

16:39.790 --> 16:40.749
One second.

16:41.667 --> 16:42.626
Where did it go?

16:42.710 --> 16:44.003
Ta-da!

16:45.379 --> 16:48.090
Don't you have anything for me?

16:48.757 --> 16:49.675
Me?

16:54.596 --> 16:55.472
Ta-da!

16:57.766 --> 16:58.642
I have another one.

17:01.645 --> 17:02.771
Hey, Lim Ju-bal!

17:02.855 --> 17:04.648
Hey! I told you to knock!

17:04.732 --> 17:05.607
Can you take this?

17:05.691 --> 17:06.650
What is it?

17:11.155 --> 17:12.031
It stinks.

17:12.114 --> 17:15.451
Are you serious? I'll get you!

17:20.080 --> 17:21.081
Sorry about that.

17:22.166 --> 17:24.084
- So--
- Good night, I'll call you tomorrow!

17:25.127 --> 17:25.961
Darn it!

17:30.340 --> 17:31.341
It stinks.

17:48.859 --> 17:49.985
What's this?

17:50.069 --> 17:51.653
Hey, Seo-jun!

17:51.737 --> 17:53.906
Open the door! Hey!

17:54.615 --> 17:55.657
Seo-jun!

18:06.210 --> 18:07.753
We finally get to see each other.

18:07.836 --> 18:08.921
I'll see you at school!

18:09.004 --> 18:09.963
BOYFRIEND

18:10.464 --> 18:11.757
Come home early, okay?

18:11.840 --> 18:14.051
She's just like her dad, wandering around.

18:14.134 --> 18:15.511
Bye, Mom!

18:15.594 --> 18:16.845
That brat.

18:21.391 --> 18:23.268
- I'm already here.
- Already?

18:33.821 --> 18:35.280
You must have left home early.

18:35.364 --> 18:37.533
You must be tired.
Why didn't you go straight to school?

18:37.616 --> 18:38.951
We can't do this at school.

18:39.535 --> 18:41.203
Let's hold hands until the bus stop.

18:42.704 --> 18:46.125
Are you okay with this, though?
You wanted to tell people.

18:46.208 --> 18:49.169
Well, that was the jealousy talking.

18:50.212 --> 18:51.171
Jealousy?

18:52.005 --> 18:53.632
There's no need for that.

18:54.508 --> 18:56.760
We'll tell everyone
when you feel comfortable.

18:58.220 --> 19:00.389
By the way, did Su-jin…

19:00.472 --> 19:01.974
What's that?

19:03.767 --> 19:04.935
It's nothing.

19:07.312 --> 19:08.313
Excuse me.

19:10.274 --> 19:11.567
Your bag was open.

19:12.526 --> 19:13.443
Thanks.

19:14.111 --> 19:16.822
Aren't you the new girl?
I saw you in the teachers' office.

19:17.865 --> 19:18.782
Yes.

19:20.868 --> 19:22.077
Joo Hye-min?

19:23.495 --> 19:24.663
That's a pretty name.

19:33.088 --> 19:34.840
Lim Ju-kyung!

20:03.118 --> 20:04.703
Lim Ju-kyung?

20:11.001 --> 20:11.919
Let's go, Su-jin.

20:24.806 --> 20:26.016
What's Hye-min doing here?

20:27.309 --> 20:28.769
She was in our school uniform.

20:29.269 --> 20:31.521
Did she transfer here?
Why, all of a sudden?

20:31.605 --> 20:32.522
What is it?

20:32.606 --> 20:33.565
Is something wrong?

20:33.649 --> 20:34.483
What?

20:35.234 --> 20:37.361
No, it's nothing.

20:40.864 --> 20:43.033
Hey, Soo-ho! Did your dad retire?

20:44.076 --> 20:45.911
Congratulations on your full recovery.

20:45.994 --> 20:47.412
- Applause.
- Applause.

20:48.205 --> 20:49.373
There's no need for that.

20:53.752 --> 20:54.753
Hey, Soo-ho.

20:56.296 --> 20:57.422
You removed your cast?

20:57.506 --> 20:58.882
So what if he did?

20:58.966 --> 20:59.800
I did.

21:00.467 --> 21:01.635
Are they going to fight?

21:01.718 --> 21:02.552
That's good.

21:05.305 --> 21:06.765
Are you sleeping already?

21:07.808 --> 21:10.269
- Yes.
- What's this calm vibe?

21:10.352 --> 21:11.311
I guess it's better.

21:11.395 --> 21:13.563
Yes, friends should be nice to each other.

21:14.106 --> 21:15.857
Hey, Limju, you're here!

21:15.941 --> 21:17.192
Hey, take a look.

21:17.734 --> 21:20.112
I submitted your picture
to the Newstagram Goddess Competition.

21:20.195 --> 21:22.281
Look, you're in second place right now!

21:22.364 --> 21:24.908
You aren't that far behind,
so you could even win.

21:24.992 --> 21:26.660
I see.

21:26.743 --> 21:28.787
Are there perks for the winner?
Some money?

21:28.870 --> 21:31.665
No, but it just feels good to win.

21:32.249 --> 21:33.917
The leader of Girls On,
who debuted this spring,

21:34.001 --> 21:35.711
was the winner last year.

21:35.794 --> 21:38.213
She got super famous,
and the agency scouted her.

21:38.297 --> 21:40.716
So what's good about being super famous?

21:40.799 --> 21:44.428
Well, it just feels good
to be super famous.

21:44.511 --> 21:46.847
I don't feel good at all.

21:46.930 --> 21:49.182
It somehow became
an interschool competition.

21:49.266 --> 21:51.852
Everyone's voting for the girl
from their own school.

21:52.853 --> 21:54.938
Even though I got dropped out quickly,

21:55.022 --> 21:58.108
I want you to win
for the honor of our school.

21:58.650 --> 22:01.153
Yongpa High's girl
is annoyingly in the lead. Look.

22:05.741 --> 22:06.742
Park Sam-mi?

22:18.253 --> 22:19.421
- A goddess!
- A goddess!

22:19.504 --> 22:21.173
And she's right next to me!

22:21.256 --> 22:22.382
It's only natural, isn't it?

22:22.466 --> 22:25.635
Hey, you practically begged everyone
to vote for you.

22:25.719 --> 22:26.553
Right?

22:32.684 --> 22:35.562
Hey, why did you submit my picture?
Please take it down.

22:35.645 --> 22:38.732
It can't be taken down
while people are voting.

22:38.815 --> 22:40.067
What?

22:40.150 --> 22:44.321
Hey, guys, log onto Newstagram
and vote for Limju! Hurry!

22:49.451 --> 22:50.660
Like Ju-kyung's post only.

22:50.744 --> 22:53.371
- Only Ju-kyung.
- Vote twice if you can.

23:05.467 --> 23:06.510
HORROR, MIDNIGHT BUS

23:06.593 --> 23:10.013
JUNIOR CLASS 5, NUMBER 25, LIM JU-KYUNG

23:17.938 --> 23:19.106
What is it?

23:19.189 --> 23:20.023
What?

23:20.732 --> 23:22.442
Do you have something to say?

23:22.526 --> 23:23.610
No, it's nothing.

23:24.277 --> 23:26.947
Goodness, Ju-kyung got an A-plus?

23:27.823 --> 23:30.117
- Excuse me?
- She got a good grade.

23:30.784 --> 23:31.993
An A-plus.

23:33.703 --> 23:36.748
Is there any reason
she doesn't deserve an A-plus?

23:36.832 --> 23:38.875
Her focus on horror fiction
was refreshing.

23:38.959 --> 23:41.753
Her criticism of the division
between literary and genre fiction

23:41.837 --> 23:43.421
was logical and laid out well.

23:43.505 --> 23:45.590
This grade follows
the grading criteria to a T.

23:45.674 --> 23:48.051
I didn't give her special treatment.

23:48.635 --> 23:52.806
Your long-winded explanation
sounds like a petty excuse to me!

23:53.849 --> 23:55.350
Now I'm actually suspicious.

23:55.433 --> 23:56.726
It wasn't long-winded…

23:57.644 --> 23:58.478
"Petty"?

23:59.104 --> 23:59.938
Me?

24:00.522 --> 24:01.648
When?

24:02.649 --> 24:03.483
Excuse me.

24:04.484 --> 24:05.318
Sorry.

24:18.540 --> 24:19.374
Soo-ho.

24:22.627 --> 24:25.297
- Is your leg all better now?
- Yes.

24:25.380 --> 24:27.174
That's great, I was worried.

24:28.049 --> 24:29.718
What are you doing after school?

24:29.801 --> 24:31.052
Can we talk?

24:31.136 --> 24:33.221
What is it? We can talk now.

24:33.805 --> 24:36.892
Well, not here. Can we talk later--

24:36.975 --> 24:38.101
I already have plans.

24:38.852 --> 24:41.354
Is it important? Can't you cancel it?

24:42.772 --> 24:44.774
It's something
I can only talk to you about.

24:45.358 --> 24:47.485
Su-jin seemed to be that reason.

24:49.321 --> 24:50.947
I have plans with my girlfriend.

24:53.241 --> 24:54.409
I didn't tell you before.

24:55.243 --> 24:56.203
It's Ju-kyung.

24:56.745 --> 24:57.579
My girlfriend.

24:59.706 --> 25:01.082
I'm not sure why,

25:01.166 --> 25:03.501
but she doesn't feel comfortable
telling people yet,

25:03.585 --> 25:05.086
so pretend you don't know.

25:06.630 --> 25:08.340
Then why are you telling me?

25:08.423 --> 25:10.050
I thought I should tell you.

25:11.718 --> 25:12.552
You're my friend.

25:41.373 --> 25:43.041
Hey, people could see.

25:43.833 --> 25:45.085
It'll be okay if I do this.

25:46.044 --> 25:46.878
What?

25:47.754 --> 25:49.589
What? Soo-ho must still be recovering.

25:49.673 --> 25:51.549
- Get better soon, Soo-ho.
- Thanks.

25:51.633 --> 25:53.718
- How is he so tall?
- Way taller than you.

25:54.386 --> 25:55.262
You see?

25:56.388 --> 25:58.473
Is something wrong? You don't look well.

25:59.432 --> 26:00.809
No, it's nothing.

26:00.892 --> 26:01.935
Hey, they're looking.

26:04.354 --> 26:06.064
Kangsu said she saved our seats.

26:06.147 --> 26:07.399
She's right there.

26:08.066 --> 26:09.818
- Enjoy your meal!
- Enjoy!

26:09.901 --> 26:10.777
Hey.

26:10.860 --> 26:13.655
- You're here.
- Gosh, I'm so hungry.

26:19.869 --> 26:21.663
Kangsu, who is this?

26:22.831 --> 26:23.790
This is Hye-min.

26:23.873 --> 26:26.584
We had a joint class together
and came to lunch after.

26:26.668 --> 26:27.544
I see.

26:27.627 --> 26:29.087
- Hi.
- Hi.

26:29.170 --> 26:30.422
Hi.

26:30.505 --> 26:32.590
I haven't seen you before.
Did you transfer?

26:32.674 --> 26:35.468
- Where are you from?
- She transferred from Yongpa High School.

26:37.679 --> 26:38.513
I see.

26:38.596 --> 26:40.307
What? Yongpa High, again?

26:40.390 --> 26:44.019
Limju, those guys who grabbed you
were also from Yongpa High School.

26:44.102 --> 26:45.437
They're so annoying.

26:45.520 --> 26:48.356
By the way, Ju-kyung,
you also transferred here.

26:48.440 --> 26:50.066
Where did you say you were from?

26:52.360 --> 26:53.528
You never told us, right?

26:53.611 --> 26:54.988
That's right.

26:55.071 --> 26:56.573
I don't think I've heard either.

26:56.656 --> 26:57.949
Where did you transfer from?

26:58.950 --> 26:59.784
Well…

27:01.244 --> 27:03.913
I'm actually from far away.

27:05.623 --> 27:06.458
Hey,

27:07.792 --> 27:09.210
don't we know each other?

27:13.256 --> 27:16.509
There was also a girl named
Lim Ju-kyung at my old school.

27:17.677 --> 27:19.179
I thought you looked like her.

27:22.182 --> 27:23.266
Really?

27:23.933 --> 27:26.144
Limju, did you transfer
from Yongpa High School?

27:27.228 --> 27:28.063
No.

27:29.230 --> 27:30.106
I don't know you.

27:31.483 --> 27:33.610
I'm not sure how similar we look,

27:33.693 --> 27:35.862
but I didn't go to Yongpa High,
so get it straight.

27:37.906 --> 27:39.491
Right.

27:40.450 --> 27:41.284
I'm sorry.

27:41.368 --> 27:43.661
You didn't need to be that harsh.

27:45.205 --> 27:47.290
I'm not feeling well. Excuse me.

27:49.584 --> 27:51.127
- Limju.
- Ju-kyung.

27:53.463 --> 27:54.756
Is she that sick?

28:03.640 --> 28:05.975
Do you really not know
or are you just playing dumb?

28:13.066 --> 28:15.193
Can makeup make that much of a difference?

28:15.276 --> 28:16.403
Even beyond recognition?

28:16.945 --> 28:17.779
What?

28:22.659 --> 28:25.620
PRINCE COMICS

28:26.204 --> 28:27.747
She couldn't have recognized me.

28:28.832 --> 28:30.708
At least she's not in my class.

28:32.085 --> 28:33.086
That's it.

28:33.169 --> 28:35.088
I won't get caught
if I don't get involved.

28:42.804 --> 28:43.680
What are you doing?

28:47.392 --> 28:48.435
It's nothing.

28:55.734 --> 28:57.110
Here, this is for you.

29:00.864 --> 29:02.741
Only kind people can see it.

29:02.824 --> 29:05.660
There's a watch in there. Do you see it?
It's really expensive.

29:08.121 --> 29:09.122
Give it to me.

29:10.957 --> 29:12.792
If you ever feel out of breath again,

29:12.876 --> 29:14.335
put this over your mouth,

29:14.419 --> 29:18.673
inhale, then exhale,
and soon you'll calm down.

29:18.757 --> 29:20.341
Always take it with you, okay?

29:23.887 --> 29:24.804
There's more?

29:24.888 --> 29:26.931
And these are worry dolls.

29:27.432 --> 29:29.726
If you can't sleep at night,
talk to these guys.

29:29.809 --> 29:32.896
Tell them all your sadness and worries.

29:32.979 --> 29:34.606
If you sleep with them under your pillow,

29:34.689 --> 29:36.858
they will take away your troubles
as you sleep.

29:36.941 --> 29:38.902
Come on, isn't that just a superstition?

29:38.985 --> 29:42.113
Hey, this is what people do
during psychological therapy.

29:42.197 --> 29:43.740
I looked it all up.

29:51.498 --> 29:53.708
They say knitting is good
for calming the mind.

29:54.375 --> 29:56.002
- Knitting?
- Yes.

29:57.921 --> 29:59.130
And lastly,

29:59.631 --> 30:00.632
ta-da!

30:01.216 --> 30:03.468
I got it with my part-time pay.

30:03.551 --> 30:05.428
It's our first matching item. Open it.

30:11.559 --> 30:12.477
Aren't they cute?

30:13.812 --> 30:17.232
But if we wear these and go to school,
won't everyone notice?

30:17.315 --> 30:18.441
I know.

30:19.067 --> 30:23.071
When we can actually tell them,
let's put these on then.

30:23.154 --> 30:24.572
It's for keeping then?

30:24.656 --> 30:26.908
Just keeping it boosts your mood, right?

30:34.999 --> 30:36.042
Hey,

30:36.876 --> 30:38.002
by any chance,

30:38.086 --> 30:41.047
have you spoken with your dad since then?

30:44.425 --> 30:45.385
No.

30:46.469 --> 30:48.304
I know it can't happen anytime soon,

30:49.430 --> 30:52.225
but I hope you'll speak to him
at least once.

30:54.644 --> 30:56.729
I don't want you to have regrets.

31:00.400 --> 31:01.234
Okay.

31:03.611 --> 31:04.571
These worry dolls…

31:05.864 --> 31:08.449
Don't you need them more?
You worry constantly.

31:11.953 --> 31:13.413
No, these are for you.

31:13.955 --> 31:15.415
They are so cute.

31:15.498 --> 31:16.666
I know, right?

31:18.042 --> 31:19.502
They all have different expressions.

31:19.586 --> 31:21.462
RANK 3, SUNIL HIGH, KIM DA-YE

31:21.546 --> 31:22.881
RANK 1, YONGPA HIGH, PARK SAM-MI

31:24.424 --> 31:25.758
What? She's in the lead?

31:28.761 --> 31:30.346
RANK 2, SAEBOM HIGH, LIM JU-KYUNG

31:30.430 --> 31:31.848
It should be Lim Ju-kyung.

31:37.896 --> 31:39.022
Where is it?

31:40.899 --> 31:42.066
What are you looking for?

31:42.150 --> 31:43.234
My hoodie.

31:43.318 --> 31:44.360
Did Mom put it in here?

31:46.571 --> 31:47.572
What is it?

31:49.282 --> 31:50.450
Are you all right?

31:51.492 --> 31:53.536
It stinks. You kept your cast?

31:53.620 --> 31:56.456
Rise up, spirit of the tiger. Roar!

31:56.539 --> 31:57.498
Seo-jun!

31:58.291 --> 31:59.208
Roar!

31:59.292 --> 32:02.003
This used to be my right arm.
I can't just throw it away.

32:02.086 --> 32:04.672
But it's weird to hide it
like some sort of treasure.

32:04.756 --> 32:06.132
It's memorabilia, okay?

32:06.215 --> 32:07.425
When I look at this later,

32:07.508 --> 32:09.177
it'll remind me of how things were.

32:09.260 --> 32:11.179
How rough I had it.

32:11.262 --> 32:13.598
It'll bring all that back.
I can't throw it out.

32:13.681 --> 32:16.225
You're out of your mind.

32:17.352 --> 32:19.020
My toes.

32:19.103 --> 32:20.313
Are you all right?

32:27.320 --> 32:28.154
She has a point.

32:29.781 --> 32:30.949
I'll just throw it out.

32:37.580 --> 32:39.290
But it used to be my right arm…

32:40.583 --> 32:41.918
I can't just throw it away.

32:52.095 --> 32:53.680
RANK 2, SAEBOM HIGH, LIM JU-KYUNG

32:53.763 --> 32:54.597
What?

32:55.640 --> 32:56.599
Why did it get liked?

33:13.491 --> 33:19.163
FATHER

34:23.561 --> 34:24.395
Like so?

34:27.648 --> 34:29.192
Like so.

34:30.693 --> 34:32.528
Does it really have a calming effect?

34:35.990 --> 34:38.076
- She's here!
- She's here!

34:40.620 --> 34:44.582
Behold, the glorious winner of
the 2020 Newstagram Goddess Competition.

34:44.665 --> 34:48.377
Here comes Lim Ju-kyung, our goddess!

34:49.629 --> 34:50.463
What?

34:50.546 --> 34:53.132
Ju-kyung, you beat
that Yongpa High girl and won!

34:54.342 --> 34:55.176
What the heck?

34:55.843 --> 34:57.762
Why did I win the thing?

34:59.305 --> 35:00.348
Goddess,

35:00.431 --> 35:03.684
how does it feel to turn
the world of social media upside down?

35:03.768 --> 35:05.728
- How does it feel?
- How does it feel?

35:14.487 --> 35:17.573
I'm just honored to even have been
one of the finalists.

35:18.908 --> 35:20.451
- What?
- What?

35:20.535 --> 35:22.078
What? You got second place!

35:22.161 --> 35:22.995
What?

35:23.579 --> 35:26.541
- Who the hell won then?
- That hurt.

35:26.624 --> 35:27.792
WINNER, LIM JU-KYUNG

35:29.627 --> 35:31.879
Ju-kyung, you might become a celebrity!

35:33.256 --> 35:35.591
- Not just anyone can be a celebrity.
- But she might.

35:36.259 --> 35:38.511
Su-ah, this is all because of you.

35:39.595 --> 35:43.266
Ju-kyung, just enjoy this moment!

35:43.349 --> 35:46.060
- I want to be her agent.
- I'll be her stylist!

35:46.144 --> 35:48.813
- It's perfect!
- It's so good!

35:48.896 --> 35:49.939
It's perfect!

35:52.692 --> 35:54.068
What are you all doing here?

35:54.694 --> 35:55.528
Leave.

35:56.028 --> 35:59.407
I did ask Soo-ho,
but he said he'd never do it.

36:00.032 --> 36:01.909
It's troubling. What do we do?

36:01.993 --> 36:04.328
If everyone declines, then who will do it?

36:04.412 --> 36:05.246
Exactly.

36:05.955 --> 36:07.415
- Why are you all here?
- What's this?

36:07.498 --> 36:09.542
A girl from our school
is this year's Newstagram Goddess.

36:09.625 --> 36:11.210
- Lim Ju-kyung from class five.
- Amazing.

36:11.294 --> 36:12.503
If she's the Newstagram Goddess,

36:12.587 --> 36:14.922
- she'll become a celebrity.
- What? Did you say star?

36:15.590 --> 36:16.799
We have a star at our school?

36:16.883 --> 36:18.467
- My goodness.
- Who is that?

36:19.385 --> 36:20.219
Over there.

36:44.744 --> 36:46.829
How long are you going to live like this?

37:01.260 --> 37:02.345
Here.

37:06.015 --> 37:08.142
How do you trip over your own foot?

37:09.518 --> 37:10.353
Why?

37:10.853 --> 37:12.188
Were you worried when I fell?

37:12.980 --> 37:14.148
Were you sad for me?

37:14.649 --> 37:17.026
Were you scared for me?

37:22.448 --> 37:24.617
- Do you like me that much?
- What?

37:27.745 --> 37:28.829
I do.

37:30.456 --> 37:34.460
Ju-young, you're a smart guy,
so you'll get what I'm saying.

37:36.879 --> 37:39.882
I see my charms are finally working.

37:40.466 --> 37:42.385
Do you like flies or not?

37:42.468 --> 37:43.302
Flies?

37:43.886 --> 37:44.720
I hate them.

37:44.804 --> 37:47.974
If a fly buzzes around you
while you're sleeping,

37:48.057 --> 37:48.933
how would you feel?

37:49.016 --> 37:50.518
That'd be annoying and tiresome.

37:52.228 --> 37:53.187
That's correct.

37:53.729 --> 37:54.563
What?

37:54.647 --> 37:56.440
So just stop it.

37:57.024 --> 37:59.902
Since you're Ju-kyung's brother,
if you don't bother me much,

37:59.986 --> 38:01.320
we can at least be friends.

38:06.993 --> 38:07.910
A fly?

38:10.371 --> 38:12.999
- Going straight to the academy?
- Yes.

38:15.251 --> 38:16.419
- Hi.
- Hi!

38:16.502 --> 38:18.879
I'm Park Sam-mi from Yongpa High.
You know me, right?

38:23.426 --> 38:24.927
What? Hey.

38:27.555 --> 38:28.931
Amazing.

38:30.558 --> 38:31.559
I don't think so.

38:33.102 --> 38:34.937
I saw you won the Goddess Competition.

38:35.021 --> 38:36.605
You somehow even beat me.

38:39.108 --> 38:41.193
Well, you look better in the picture.

38:41.777 --> 38:44.655
Still, you look totally different
from the Lim Ju-kyung I know.

38:47.491 --> 38:48.326
Okay.

38:51.245 --> 38:52.538
Are you that busy?

38:53.414 --> 38:54.999
It's as if you're avoiding me.

38:57.835 --> 38:59.837
By the way, why isn't Han Seo-jun
coming out?

39:01.005 --> 39:02.298
I'm not sure.

39:02.965 --> 39:03.799
Let's go, Su-jin.

39:06.093 --> 39:07.678
Jeez, she's totally ignoring me.

39:07.762 --> 39:11.390
- What? That's Joo Hye-min!
- Hey, Hye-min!

39:11.932 --> 39:13.642
Where are you going?

39:14.268 --> 39:15.603
Hye-min!

39:16.604 --> 39:18.314
- Our darling girl.
- How have you been?

39:20.775 --> 39:22.526
Smile, won't you?

39:24.403 --> 39:25.321
Let's go.

39:31.160 --> 39:34.205
Hey, you dare ignore our texts?
Do you have a death wish?

39:35.206 --> 39:37.750
I told you it wasn't like that.

39:38.751 --> 39:42.088
I've watched them,
and she doesn't have a thing with Seo-jun.

39:44.048 --> 39:45.508
Do you still think so?

39:45.591 --> 39:46.801
You little brat.

39:48.594 --> 39:50.221
Hey, from now on,

39:50.304 --> 39:53.265
keep following her around
and dig up some dirt on her.

39:53.849 --> 39:56.018
See if she flirts with other guys.

39:56.102 --> 39:58.896
or has a bad temper.
Find me her dirty secrets.

39:59.563 --> 40:02.149
Then I'll be able
to break them up, got it?

40:03.818 --> 40:05.361
Are you not going to answer?

40:06.028 --> 40:07.238
Joo Hye-min!

40:10.825 --> 40:12.743
Were you beating her up?

40:13.411 --> 40:14.912
No way.

40:14.995 --> 40:17.540
We were just talking. What's up?

40:21.377 --> 40:22.294
You…

40:23.421 --> 40:25.464
were going to do homework with us today.

40:27.258 --> 40:28.384
Did you forget?

40:29.051 --> 40:29.885
What?

40:30.970 --> 40:32.054
Right.

40:32.555 --> 40:35.724
She's coming with us today.

40:40.896 --> 40:42.398
Homework is way more important.

40:43.023 --> 40:45.067
- Let's go.
- Where do you think you're going?

40:51.532 --> 40:52.366
Hey,

40:52.992 --> 40:54.160
who are you to butt in?

40:54.827 --> 40:57.538
You're from Yongpa High School, right?

41:08.716 --> 41:09.758
Thanks.

41:11.385 --> 41:12.470
I'm going to leave.

41:13.095 --> 41:13.929
Wait.

41:15.514 --> 41:17.683
You're Ju-kyung, right?

41:22.146 --> 41:23.814
Thanks for helping me.

41:25.107 --> 41:27.943
By the way, Ju-kyung, you got so pretty.

41:28.777 --> 41:30.779
- I didn't recognize you at--
- Helping you…

41:33.073 --> 41:34.533
doesn't mean I've forgiven you.

41:38.996 --> 41:41.499
I'm sorry for what I did back then.

41:42.833 --> 41:44.376
If I hadn't gone along with it,

41:44.460 --> 41:46.629
they would have done
what they did to you to me.

41:47.630 --> 41:49.048
I was afraid.

41:52.593 --> 41:54.553
But still, I shouldn't have done that.

41:55.304 --> 41:56.555
I'm really sorry.

42:00.142 --> 42:01.310
I don't want people…

42:02.645 --> 42:04.647
to find out about my past.

42:07.483 --> 42:09.693
So please don't act like
you know me at school.

42:09.777 --> 42:11.529
I'll never tell.

42:11.612 --> 42:13.864
I won't tell anyone, so don't worry.

42:26.502 --> 42:27.336
Spin the needle…

42:31.215 --> 42:32.132
What are you doing?

42:33.133 --> 42:33.968
Are you knitting?

42:34.760 --> 42:36.178
I hear it has a calming effect.

42:36.971 --> 42:38.138
Sure. Whatever works.

42:39.098 --> 42:40.349
Why did you want to see me?

42:40.933 --> 42:42.226
I have to ask you something.

42:42.935 --> 42:45.229
You said the reason
Ju-kyung can't say we're dating

42:46.063 --> 42:47.398
is because of Su-jin.

42:48.190 --> 42:50.401
What did you mean? Do you know something?

42:50.484 --> 42:51.860
Why do you ask?

42:51.944 --> 42:53.612
Ju-kyung's been acting weird lately.

42:54.863 --> 42:56.323
I feel like something's up.

42:56.824 --> 42:59.326
Why do you ask me about
what's worrying your girlfriend?

43:01.328 --> 43:02.705
How is she acting weird?

43:05.833 --> 43:06.750
Just the other day,

43:07.668 --> 43:09.837
she asked me about
her friend's friend's issue.

43:10.754 --> 43:12.840
Her friend's friend got a boyfriend,

43:13.340 --> 43:15.009
and her friend's friend's, well…

43:15.092 --> 43:16.260
likes her boyfriend.

43:16.343 --> 43:17.595
The friend's friend, then…

43:17.678 --> 43:20.723
The friend told her out of the blue
how she liked the boyfriend…

43:20.806 --> 43:21.890
The friend's friend…

43:21.974 --> 43:23.684
The friend's friend's…

43:23.767 --> 43:24.602
friend…

43:25.644 --> 43:27.062
If you don't get it, forget it.

43:29.064 --> 43:30.274
Then what about you?

43:30.357 --> 43:31.900
Aren't you and Su-jin old friends?

43:32.401 --> 43:34.361
Then can you drop anything
that I don't approve of?

43:34.445 --> 43:36.280
Even throw away your friends?

43:36.864 --> 43:38.073
When did she say that?

43:38.157 --> 43:39.992
When we made dumplings and cut toenails…

43:41.201 --> 43:42.036
Don't ask.

43:42.578 --> 43:43.954
I don't even want to think about it.

43:47.541 --> 43:49.585
Hey, you missed one stitch.

43:50.794 --> 43:51.962
How do you know?

43:52.046 --> 43:54.089
I tried it too when Go-un was into it.

43:54.965 --> 43:56.925
It'll be ruined
if you don't fix it right away.

43:57.009 --> 43:57.843
Really?

44:03.265 --> 44:04.141
What do I do?

44:06.435 --> 44:07.311
Let me see.

44:10.230 --> 44:11.899
You can't pull off this simple task?

44:13.067 --> 44:14.943
No, not like that.

44:17.488 --> 44:18.822
Lee Soo-ho!

44:18.906 --> 44:20.282
You said we were friends.

44:20.366 --> 44:23.535
You never came along when I begged you
to go to an Internet cafe.

44:23.619 --> 44:25.537
You hang out with him
now that you made up?

44:25.621 --> 44:27.081
How can a love… no.

44:27.873 --> 44:28.999
How can a friendship change?

44:29.083 --> 44:30.167
What's with him?

44:31.919 --> 44:34.129
- Do you know how to knit?
- Yes.

44:34.213 --> 44:35.881
I knitted a scarf for Tu-ah once.

44:35.964 --> 44:37.007
Are you knitting?

44:39.176 --> 44:40.803
- So I put this here,
- Through here,

44:40.886 --> 44:41.929
then wrap it around.

44:42.012 --> 44:43.847
- Hey, Han Seo-jun!
- Like that?

44:43.931 --> 44:45.182
Seriously?

44:45.265 --> 44:47.476
You ignored me when I asked you
to go to karaoke!

44:47.559 --> 44:48.686
And now you're here?

44:48.769 --> 44:51.730
How can our friendship change like this?

44:53.232 --> 44:54.316
Come sit.

44:55.234 --> 44:56.235
I'm hungry.

44:58.445 --> 44:59.947
Were you waiting long?

45:00.030 --> 45:01.407
Did your class go well?

45:01.490 --> 45:02.324
Yes.

45:02.825 --> 45:06.036
- You didn't have to come all this way.
- I wanted to walk with you.

45:10.207 --> 45:11.041
Ju-kyung.

45:11.917 --> 45:12.751
Yes?

45:12.835 --> 45:13.669
Right now,

45:14.586 --> 45:16.422
do you feel good or bad?

45:17.005 --> 45:18.090
Why do you ask?

45:18.173 --> 45:19.174
Just because.

45:19.258 --> 45:22.386
Good or bad?

45:25.180 --> 45:26.014
Good.

45:31.478 --> 45:33.397
Are you not going to tell me what's wrong?

45:35.357 --> 45:36.400
Actually…

45:38.026 --> 45:40.112
A girl from my former school
transferred here.

45:41.029 --> 45:42.030
What?

45:42.114 --> 45:43.699
Was it not about Su-jin?

45:44.283 --> 45:47.578
I thought she wouldn't recognize me,
but she did right away.

45:48.412 --> 45:49.580
Are you all right?

45:50.247 --> 45:51.498
I'm nervous,

45:52.249 --> 45:54.418
but thankfully,
she promised not to tell anyone.

45:55.002 --> 45:56.128
You must have been shocked.

45:57.963 --> 45:58.881
Just a little.

46:00.966 --> 46:02.926
But I'm really okay now.

46:12.853 --> 46:13.896
Aren't you hungry?

46:13.979 --> 46:15.439
We could go get something yummy.

46:17.733 --> 46:18.859
What do you want to eat?

46:19.860 --> 46:20.986
Anything you like.

46:28.994 --> 46:31.121
I didn't get pretty at all.

46:34.666 --> 46:36.418
My acne is acting up again.

46:38.670 --> 46:40.506
BLACKHEAD REMOVER

46:45.928 --> 46:47.596
It's so annoying.

46:48.847 --> 46:50.849
Hee-kyung, do you want
to go on a blind date?

46:50.933 --> 46:53.018
The pork trotters place's son
has a friend--

46:53.101 --> 46:53.977
I have a boyfriend.

46:55.521 --> 46:56.855
- A boyfriend?
- A boyfriend?

46:57.397 --> 46:59.566
That's not a lie
to get out of the blind date?

47:00.108 --> 47:01.276
No, I'm serious.

47:01.902 --> 47:04.655
What? How long has it been?
What does he do?

47:04.738 --> 47:05.948
Is he handsome? How old is he?

47:06.865 --> 47:09.493
It's a secret for now.
I'll introduce you when we're ready.

47:09.576 --> 47:10.911
Do you have his picture?

47:10.994 --> 47:13.330
I can tell what kind of person he is
by his looks.

47:13.956 --> 47:15.916
I'm dying to know more, seriously!

47:15.999 --> 47:18.085
What is he like?

47:20.128 --> 47:21.213
My grapefruit.

47:21.964 --> 47:22.839
Grapefruit?

47:22.923 --> 47:25.884
The more I get to know him,
the more adorable I find him.

47:26.593 --> 47:28.971
He's as refreshing as a fruit.

47:30.097 --> 47:31.390
"Refreshing as a fruit"?

47:31.473 --> 47:32.933
I'm home.

47:33.016 --> 47:34.935
You're home, Ju-young! Have some dinner.

47:36.103 --> 47:38.313
A mere fly doesn't deserve dinner.

47:44.236 --> 47:47.489
Junior Lim Ju-kyung,
please come to the auditorium.

47:48.073 --> 47:49.199
You look so pretty!

47:50.450 --> 47:51.618
Show us more confidence!

47:51.702 --> 47:53.870
Ju-kyung! You're doing great!

47:53.954 --> 47:55.747
Gosh, you look pretty!

47:55.831 --> 47:58.292
Goodness, the goddess is here!

48:00.043 --> 48:02.546
You really have turned
the stage upside down!

48:02.629 --> 48:04.840
- You're super pretty!
- You look super nice!

48:05.632 --> 48:08.385
How did I end up here?

48:09.303 --> 48:12.180
- She's a perfect school model!
- She sure is.

48:12.264 --> 48:13.223
A moment, please.

48:14.182 --> 48:16.643
Sir, do I really have to do this?

48:17.144 --> 48:21.064
The school president or the top student
is usually the school model, no?

48:21.148 --> 48:21.982
That's right.

48:22.065 --> 48:24.526
But Ju-kyung, they didn't want to do it.

48:24.610 --> 48:25.444
Excuse me?

48:26.236 --> 48:27.779
Then why do I have to…

48:27.863 --> 48:29.406
What do you mean, "have to"?

48:30.198 --> 48:32.284
I heard you were the star of the school.

48:32.367 --> 48:33.619
A star of all stars.

48:33.702 --> 48:35.746
Why wouldn't we want the star
to be our model?

48:35.829 --> 48:38.373
The main star of Saebom High School!

48:41.960 --> 48:43.337
Can you do the pose again?

48:43.962 --> 48:45.422
You are so pretty, Ju-kyung!

48:48.967 --> 48:50.344
You look so lovely!

48:50.886 --> 48:51.887
Do it right, okay?

48:51.970 --> 48:53.180
Correct your form.

48:53.805 --> 48:57.601
Our school's website
will feature your face then?

48:57.684 --> 49:01.438
The best-looking person at Saebom High,
Lim Ju-kyung!

49:01.521 --> 49:03.440
Please don't.

49:03.523 --> 49:05.108
As if I'm the best-looking person.

49:05.192 --> 49:06.902
How many have you done to get sick?

49:06.985 --> 49:10.656
- Three, four, five…
- I did a hundred in a minute at your age.

49:10.739 --> 49:13.575
So did they make up
after staying in the hospital together?

49:13.659 --> 49:15.494
As in misery loves company?

49:15.577 --> 49:17.079
- Seven.
- Something's wrong.

49:17.162 --> 49:18.455
Hold my legs properly.

49:18.538 --> 49:19.665
- Hurry up.
- Okay.

49:19.748 --> 49:22.000
- Do it again.
- Jeez.

49:22.084 --> 49:24.127
- One.
- Why are you counting from one?

49:25.712 --> 49:26.755
When I was your age…

49:26.838 --> 49:28.465
PARK SAM-MI
NEW MESSAGE

49:29.299 --> 49:30.384
Who is it?

49:31.259 --> 49:33.345
- No one.
- Don't fool around and do it right.

49:33.428 --> 49:34.888
Put some effort into it.

49:35.389 --> 49:36.640
Are you counting correctly?

49:42.896 --> 49:45.023
What was that?
Why are you taking my picture?

49:45.607 --> 49:46.441
Because you looked good?

49:48.527 --> 49:49.820
Don't you like Soo-ho?

49:50.487 --> 49:51.655
Yes. So?

49:52.614 --> 49:55.200
- Don't you know he's dating Ju-kyung?
- I know.

49:55.283 --> 49:57.953
But that didn't stop you
from liking Ju-kyung, did it?

50:10.924 --> 50:12.843
CAN YOU SEND PICS OF LIM JU-KYUNG?
SAM-MI: THEN YOU SEND PICS OF SEO-JUN!

50:16.930 --> 50:19.182
IT'S A GIVE-AND-TAKE.
JUST ONE PICTURE, PLEASE?

50:28.400 --> 50:30.944
He looks totally dreamy, thanks!

50:31.027 --> 50:33.405
But why do you want photos of her?

50:49.087 --> 50:50.380
Are these all you have?

50:51.965 --> 50:54.134
- I'm hungry after running.
- Let's go to the snack bar.

50:54.718 --> 50:56.344
Okay, what should we get?

50:57.262 --> 50:58.221
Goodness, Limju.

51:00.307 --> 51:01.391
I'm sorry.

51:04.478 --> 51:05.562
Are you okay?

51:35.342 --> 51:37.469
Limju, what's wrong?
Looking for something?

51:37.552 --> 51:40.055
What do I do? I lost my necklace.

51:41.139 --> 51:42.724
Where is it? I never took it off.

51:42.808 --> 51:44.267
The one you always wear?

51:44.351 --> 51:45.977
- Yes.
- When was the last you saw it?

51:46.937 --> 51:48.313
I saw it this morning.

51:48.897 --> 51:50.857
Maybe it came loose during PE class?

51:51.525 --> 51:52.442
You think so?

51:52.526 --> 51:55.070
- I'll help you find it. Let's go.
- Thank you.

52:09.459 --> 52:11.378
Where is it?

52:15.340 --> 52:17.300
It should be somewhere here.

52:17.384 --> 52:18.760
I told her not to look for it.

52:19.553 --> 52:21.304
She'll be here all night at this rate.

52:27.435 --> 52:28.562
You won't find it here.

52:30.647 --> 52:32.274
Someone must have already taken it.

52:32.357 --> 52:34.192
It wasn't at the lost and found.

52:34.276 --> 52:36.319
And I trust the people at our school.

52:36.987 --> 52:38.113
What school pride.

52:38.655 --> 52:41.199
- Because you're now the school model?
- No, it's not.

52:41.867 --> 52:43.994
Hey, back off.
I don't want you to step on it.

52:44.077 --> 52:45.161
Shall I help you look?

52:45.745 --> 52:46.955
What will you give me?

52:48.665 --> 52:50.292
I'll treat you to spicy tteokbokki.

52:50.375 --> 52:53.211
No. Can you treat me
to something other than that?

52:53.295 --> 52:54.754
Why? You like that.

52:54.838 --> 52:56.590
- You said you always crave it.
- Anyway.

52:57.299 --> 52:59.134
Treat me big time if I find it for you.

52:59.885 --> 53:01.052
Okay!

53:05.473 --> 53:08.184
- I found it!
- What? Really?

53:09.936 --> 53:11.438
500 won. It's huge.

53:12.439 --> 53:13.523
What the heck?

53:20.822 --> 53:21.990
It's for real this time.

53:22.073 --> 53:23.366
Is this your necklace?

53:23.450 --> 53:24.993
Did you find it?

53:29.497 --> 53:30.832
Why don't you just go home?

53:30.916 --> 53:33.376
Okay. I'll try harder this time.

53:33.460 --> 53:35.211
Don't play around.

53:35.879 --> 53:38.381
Soo-ho gave it to me as a gift,
so I need to find it.

53:39.090 --> 53:40.216
Jeez.

53:41.468 --> 53:44.220
- I'm heading home.
- What? You said you'll help.

53:44.304 --> 53:45.722
I'm a busy person.

53:45.805 --> 53:47.933
Do you have to look for it
in this weather?

53:49.059 --> 53:51.227
Is Soo-ho being petty about you losing it?

53:51.311 --> 53:52.479
No.

53:53.605 --> 53:54.898
It's important to me.

53:55.774 --> 53:57.317
That's why I want to find it.

53:58.193 --> 54:00.654
If it's so important,
you should've kept it safe.

54:00.737 --> 54:03.114
I know. What was I thinking?

54:03.907 --> 54:06.493
I'm not going home
until I find the necklace.

54:10.455 --> 54:11.414
Good luck.

54:12.207 --> 54:13.041
I'm leaving.

54:18.588 --> 54:19.589
What are these for?

54:21.967 --> 54:22.968
Whatever.

54:36.564 --> 54:37.857
How will I find it?

54:43.154 --> 54:44.030
Looking for this?

54:48.493 --> 54:49.869
Su-jin.

54:56.334 --> 54:57.293
What was that for?

54:59.212 --> 55:00.922
You knew who that belonged to.

55:01.589 --> 55:02.966
Yes, I did.

55:03.049 --> 55:04.926
Then why did you do that?

55:06.136 --> 55:07.137
Because I like you.

55:09.180 --> 55:10.390
You're not even surprised.

55:11.141 --> 55:12.142
Did you know?

55:12.225 --> 55:14.519
Do you think this makes sense?

55:15.228 --> 55:17.063
Aren't you friends with Ju-kyung?

55:17.147 --> 55:19.357
If only you give her up,
we can still be friends.

55:20.025 --> 55:22.986
- What?
- Ju-kyung is cheerful, kind, and warm.

55:23.069 --> 55:24.487
I like her too.

55:24.571 --> 55:25.405
But…

55:26.531 --> 55:28.158
not as much as I like you.

55:28.241 --> 55:31.077
I'd rather lose her than you.

55:31.161 --> 55:34.247
So, if you don't want to see her
lose a friend and get hurt,

55:34.330 --> 55:35.373
break up with her.

55:37.083 --> 55:38.001
Are you…

55:39.294 --> 55:41.212
the same Kang Su-jin I used to know?

55:41.296 --> 55:43.173
Why did it have to be Ju-kyung?

55:47.719 --> 55:49.387
You haven't known her for that long.

55:49.471 --> 55:52.265
Why her and not me who's been with you
for the past ten years?

55:54.017 --> 55:57.353
Can't you just break up with Ju-kyung
and like me instead?

55:57.437 --> 55:58.688
That will make things okay.

55:59.272 --> 56:01.149
If I had told you I liked you first,

56:01.232 --> 56:03.276
wouldn't you have chosen me anyway?

56:06.780 --> 56:07.697
No.

56:09.699 --> 56:10.742
I wouldn't have.

56:42.107 --> 56:43.691
Don't look for the necklace.

56:57.330 --> 56:58.957
Should I have just one more?

56:59.874 --> 57:00.792
It's getting late.

57:00.875 --> 57:03.545
Yes, it's getting late.
I really shouldn't.

57:05.296 --> 57:08.049
I'll go on a diet and become handsome.
I'm done.

57:08.133 --> 57:09.425
I don't think it's possible.

57:10.260 --> 57:11.344
What?

57:11.427 --> 57:12.262
Come on.

57:12.762 --> 57:15.181
I actually look all right
if I lose some weight!

57:18.768 --> 57:19.602
I'm leaving.

57:20.437 --> 57:22.397
You didn't even finish.
Where are you going?

57:24.858 --> 57:25.692
So wasteful.

57:26.276 --> 57:28.069
I'm putting on weight because of you.

57:43.626 --> 57:45.962
Did someone really find it and take it?

57:54.679 --> 57:56.055
- Ju-kyung.
- My gosh!

58:01.102 --> 58:02.562
I knew you'd be still here.

58:02.645 --> 58:04.898
I didn't want to give up
without looking for it.

58:04.981 --> 58:06.274
Do you know how late it is?

58:06.357 --> 58:09.152
I was going to leave
after looking here anyway.

58:10.195 --> 58:12.739
Then we're going to leave
after searching here, okay?

58:12.822 --> 58:13.907
Okay.

58:15.992 --> 58:18.453
You search over there.
I'll search over here.

58:18.536 --> 58:19.954
I already looked over there.

58:20.038 --> 58:21.789
It wasn't there. Let's look over here.

58:21.873 --> 58:22.707
Still,

58:23.583 --> 58:25.084
why don't you go look again?

58:25.168 --> 58:27.587
I double-checked every speck of dust.

58:27.670 --> 58:29.005
It just can't be there.

58:29.088 --> 58:31.299
Never say never. Are you 100% sure?

58:32.091 --> 58:33.134
100%?

58:34.594 --> 58:36.971
Well, not that much…

58:37.055 --> 58:39.432
Then go look again.

58:41.309 --> 58:42.435
Okay.

58:43.311 --> 58:44.854
I looked there earlier…

59:00.119 --> 59:00.954
I found it!

59:02.872 --> 59:04.290
What a relief.

59:09.963 --> 59:11.089
That's great.

59:12.257 --> 59:13.341
Why did I come here?

59:15.760 --> 59:18.221
See? It's a good thing I looked for it.

59:18.304 --> 59:19.138
Right?

59:19.806 --> 59:21.391
Yes, you did well.

59:24.310 --> 59:25.311
I'll do it for you.

59:59.971 --> 01:00:01.806
Hey, who's there?

01:00:04.892 --> 01:00:05.727
Let's go.

01:00:19.365 --> 01:00:20.908
Someone was here for sure.

01:00:40.470 --> 01:00:41.804
Was I seeing things?

01:00:45.850 --> 01:00:47.101
Hee-kyung!

01:00:49.312 --> 01:00:51.773
- Are you okay, Hee-kyung?
- Okay.

01:00:52.899 --> 01:00:54.025
Mr. Han?

01:00:56.069 --> 01:00:56.903
Hello.

01:00:59.614 --> 01:01:00.615
Hi.

01:01:09.582 --> 01:01:13.002
I'm bored. Should we go to karaoke?

01:01:13.086 --> 01:01:13.920
Hey,

01:01:14.545 --> 01:01:15.463
how does this look?

01:01:15.546 --> 01:01:17.632
- Not pretty.
- Not pretty?

01:01:18.883 --> 01:01:21.094
- Something is off.
- What is?

01:01:21.678 --> 01:01:23.388
Why did Lim Ju-kyung's friend

01:01:23.471 --> 01:01:25.932
ask for Lim Ju-kyung's pictures?

01:01:26.516 --> 01:01:27.767
What are you talking about?

01:01:27.850 --> 01:01:29.519
Why didn't she take them herself?

01:01:29.602 --> 01:01:31.813
Well, they're two different people, so…

01:01:33.606 --> 01:01:34.649
What do you mean?

01:01:39.529 --> 01:01:41.864
I'm so dumb.

01:01:42.448 --> 01:01:45.535
KANG SU-JIN

01:01:45.618 --> 01:01:47.620
Gosh, this is crazy.

01:01:47.704 --> 01:01:48.996
Hey, Kang Su-jin!

01:01:52.291 --> 01:01:53.251
You got here fast.

01:01:53.334 --> 01:01:54.627
You called us out here?

01:01:55.336 --> 01:01:56.546
We came here to meet her?

01:01:56.629 --> 01:01:58.840
I had something to ask her too.

01:01:59.674 --> 01:02:00.508
Hey.

01:02:01.008 --> 01:02:02.427
Give me a straight answer.

01:02:03.970 --> 01:02:05.680
Is she the same person?

01:02:11.978 --> 01:02:13.521
I heard you haven't eaten yet.

01:02:14.439 --> 01:02:15.314
Well…

01:02:15.857 --> 01:02:17.692
- Let's eat first and calmly--
- You.

01:02:18.276 --> 01:02:19.652
What were you doing there so late?

01:02:19.736 --> 01:02:21.571
I could ask the same of you.

01:02:21.654 --> 01:02:23.406
I asked you first!

01:02:23.489 --> 01:02:24.574
Add the dumplings.

01:02:24.657 --> 01:02:26.617
- I was looking for my necklace.
- Necklace?

01:02:26.701 --> 01:02:27.535
What necklace?

01:02:30.121 --> 01:02:31.497
It's pretty. Was it a gift?

01:02:31.581 --> 01:02:32.415
Yes.

01:02:32.915 --> 01:02:35.626
Why were you hiding under the desk
with my teacher?

01:02:35.710 --> 01:02:37.920
- Sir, the glass noodles go in later.
- Okay.

01:02:38.004 --> 01:02:38.880
We're dating.

01:02:41.632 --> 01:02:43.092
Your "refreshing as a fruit" boyfriend…

01:02:44.594 --> 01:02:45.678
is my teacher?

01:02:45.762 --> 01:02:47.054
Are you crazy?

01:02:47.138 --> 01:02:48.431
Yes, I'm crazy in love.

01:02:48.514 --> 01:02:50.892
Can't two adults with healthy bodies
and minds be in love?

01:02:50.975 --> 01:02:51.934
It's boiling.

01:02:53.186 --> 01:02:55.396
So you were playing love games
at my school?

01:02:55.480 --> 01:02:56.856
Because you're crazy in love?

01:02:56.939 --> 01:02:58.316
I wouldn't say that.

01:02:58.399 --> 01:03:00.735
I was working late, and my Hee… No.

01:03:00.818 --> 01:03:03.279
Hee-kyung brought me some snacks…

01:03:03.362 --> 01:03:06.199
My grapefruit was so adamant
about not getting caught by you--

01:03:07.408 --> 01:03:08.326
- "Grapefruit"?
- "Grapefruit"?

01:03:08.409 --> 01:03:10.328
I hid because Jun-woo was so worried.

01:03:10.411 --> 01:03:13.873
Why did it have to be my teacher?
How can I go to school knowing this?

01:03:13.956 --> 01:03:17.043
I could say the same
about you dating my boss's son!

01:03:17.752 --> 01:03:19.003
Is it okay now that he resigned?

01:03:19.670 --> 01:03:21.798
- Anyway!
- Were there no other guys out there?

01:03:21.881 --> 01:03:23.758
My grapefruit is special!

01:03:25.259 --> 01:03:27.178
I said not to add the noodles yet!

01:03:27.261 --> 01:03:28.846
It has to boil more first!

01:03:29.347 --> 01:03:31.015
- Are we having fried rice after?
- Of course.

01:03:31.098 --> 01:03:32.141
- Extra cheese?
- Add two orders.

01:03:32.225 --> 01:03:33.810
Two fried rice, please.

01:03:33.893 --> 01:03:35.603
- Ma'am, can we have soda too?
- Sure.

01:03:35.686 --> 01:03:36.687
Goodness.

01:03:37.563 --> 01:03:38.606
She's not answering?

01:03:39.315 --> 01:03:40.316
She's making me mad.

01:03:41.400 --> 01:03:42.944
Where does Ju-kyung live again?

01:03:51.035 --> 01:03:52.662
How did those two meet anyway?

01:03:53.996 --> 01:03:56.582
How do I face him tomorrow at school?

01:03:57.333 --> 01:03:59.085
Is it that uncomfortable for you?

01:03:59.168 --> 01:04:00.461
Of course, it is.

01:04:01.045 --> 01:04:02.797
I need to be extra careful at school.

01:04:03.381 --> 01:04:05.258
He could report to my sister right away.

01:04:08.594 --> 01:04:11.389
Do you think he looks like a grapefruit?

01:04:11.472 --> 01:04:12.473
No.

01:04:13.599 --> 01:04:15.643
She must be crazy in love.

01:04:16.227 --> 01:04:17.353
PRINCE COMICS

01:04:20.314 --> 01:04:22.525
- Good night!
- Good night!

01:04:26.112 --> 01:04:26.946
Is it this way?

01:04:27.029 --> 01:04:28.698
- This way?
- This way.

01:04:29.198 --> 01:04:30.783
- This way, girl.
- This way?

01:04:30.867 --> 01:04:31.742
MY BABY SISTER

01:04:31.826 --> 01:04:32.702
Is your shift over?

01:04:52.305 --> 01:04:53.848
- It stinks.
- Where is it?

01:04:54.724 --> 01:04:55.850
I think it's over there.

01:04:55.933 --> 01:04:57.727
- She lives in a dump.
- It's so gross.

01:04:57.810 --> 01:04:58.728
Hey, Park Sam-mi.

01:05:00.646 --> 01:05:01.647
Han Seo-jun?

01:05:02.982 --> 01:05:04.358
Why are you here?

01:05:18.623 --> 01:05:19.749
We're here.

01:05:20.666 --> 01:05:21.667
Yes, we are.

01:05:26.797 --> 01:05:27.798
Hey, Han Seo-jun!

01:05:27.882 --> 01:05:29.592
Why did you come to see Ju-kyung?

01:05:29.675 --> 01:05:32.219
I wanted to talk to her
since it's been a while.

01:05:32.303 --> 01:05:35.973
- "Been a while"?
- It turns out she's someone I know.

01:05:41.312 --> 01:05:42.772
- What's this?
- Don't you get it?

01:05:43.397 --> 01:05:45.942
That's Lim Ju-kyung.

01:05:49.528 --> 01:05:50.696
He doesn't recognize her.

01:05:51.656 --> 01:05:54.158
Why? Are you shocked?

01:05:54.241 --> 01:05:56.744
She totally fooled me too.

01:05:57.244 --> 01:05:58.913
Why are you showing me this?

01:05:58.996 --> 01:06:01.123
I'm worried for you, that's why.

01:06:01.207 --> 01:06:04.377
I wouldn't want to date someone
who used to look like this, would you?

01:06:04.961 --> 01:06:08.422
She used to run errands for me.

01:06:08.506 --> 01:06:09.715
A total loser.

01:06:09.799 --> 01:06:12.218
You're way out of her league.

01:06:13.344 --> 01:06:16.013
To me, she looks prettier
than someone like you.

01:06:16.597 --> 01:06:17.431
What?

01:06:17.932 --> 01:06:19.684
Are you taking your girlfriend's side?

01:06:20.226 --> 01:06:21.519
Or are you blind?

01:06:21.602 --> 01:06:24.021
- She's covered in makeup.
- Is that okay?

01:06:24.105 --> 01:06:26.691
Come on.
Her bare face looks super ugly, and you…

01:06:27.316 --> 01:06:28.526
Goodness!

01:06:28.609 --> 01:06:30.152
Hey, Han Seo-jun!

01:06:31.070 --> 01:06:31.904
The thing is,

01:06:32.697 --> 01:06:35.241
delinquents bullying someone
reminds me of my friend,

01:06:35.324 --> 01:06:36.784
and I just can't think straight.

01:06:36.867 --> 01:06:37.994
Running errands for you?

01:06:39.036 --> 01:06:41.414
If I ever catch you
pulling a stunt like this again,

01:06:42.331 --> 01:06:43.290
you'll pay for it.

01:06:56.387 --> 01:06:58.264
You should go now.

01:06:59.390 --> 01:07:00.558
You should go in first.

01:07:02.143 --> 01:07:04.478
Okay. I'll go in now, really.

01:07:05.312 --> 01:07:06.397
I'll see you tomorrow.

01:08:04.080 --> 01:08:05.623
What we couldn't do earlier.

01:09:10.146 --> 01:09:13.899
SHINING FACE! BRIGHT SMILE!
A HAPPY SCHOOL FOR ALL!

01:09:15.860 --> 01:09:17.278
What are all these?

01:09:17.361 --> 01:09:18.696
It's embarrassing.

01:09:27.079 --> 01:09:31.333
WELCOME TO THE NEW STUDENT ORIENTATION
FOR SAEBOM HIGH SCHOOL

01:09:31.417 --> 01:09:34.879
Mom, look. I'm the school model.

01:09:36.630 --> 01:09:38.549
Look, the supposed Saebom High goddess.

01:09:39.967 --> 01:09:40.968
Hi.

01:09:41.051 --> 01:09:42.845
She's the face of our school?

01:09:43.512 --> 01:09:44.346
Let's just go.

01:09:51.770 --> 01:09:54.857
THE BRIGHT FUTURE OF SAEBOM HIGH!
A VIBRANT TOMORROW!

01:10:01.071 --> 01:10:03.324
- Hey, come here. Look at this!
- Come here.

01:10:03.407 --> 01:10:04.700
This is so ridiculous.

01:10:05.492 --> 01:10:07.703
- Preposterous, right? Look.
- Gosh.

01:10:26.931 --> 01:10:28.307
Goddess, my foot.

01:10:34.480 --> 01:10:35.731
You be the goddess instead.

01:10:49.370 --> 01:10:50.246
This is nuts.

01:10:50.329 --> 01:10:51.914
She doesn't look like the photos at all.

01:10:51.997 --> 01:10:53.874
- How is that her?
- Does that look like her?

01:10:54.458 --> 01:10:56.919
Ju-kyung, is this really you?

01:10:59.505 --> 01:11:02.049
The truth about Lim Ju-kyung,
Saebom High Goddess.

01:11:02.132 --> 01:11:04.468
She was known for running dumpling errands
before her transfer.

01:11:04.551 --> 01:11:06.428
You are all going to be so shocked.

01:11:06.512 --> 01:11:08.514
She's super ugly. It's all her makeup.

01:11:14.061 --> 01:11:15.104
- Gosh.
- That's not her.

01:11:15.187 --> 01:11:16.981
- It's two different people.
- It's crazy.

01:11:17.064 --> 01:11:18.983
- I'm rather amazed.
- Hey, it can't be true.

01:11:22.319 --> 01:11:24.613
Because you are ugly.

01:11:31.078 --> 01:11:34.081
- This is over the line.
- This is wild.

01:11:34.164 --> 01:11:36.542
Gosh, seriously. What is this?

01:12:00.941 --> 01:12:02.109
She's a fraud.

01:12:02.192 --> 01:12:04.236
Shouldn't she see a dermatologist?

01:12:12.828 --> 01:12:13.662
Ju-kyung.

01:12:23.130 --> 01:12:24.381
Ju-kyung.

01:12:30.429 --> 01:12:31.347
Ju-kyung.

01:12:52.368 --> 01:12:54.286
THANK YOU TO CHANI
FOR HIS SPECIAL APPEARANCE

01:13:20.562 --> 01:13:23.690
People now know about my true face.

01:13:23.774 --> 01:13:25.609
That's why I can't look you in the eye.

01:13:26.902 --> 01:13:28.362
Why don't you just rip it off?

01:13:28.445 --> 01:13:30.531
No one would do such a thing
other than you.

01:13:30.614 --> 01:13:31.532
You're wrong.

01:13:31.615 --> 01:13:33.200
You really didn't know?

01:13:33.283 --> 01:13:35.160
You're best friends with Ju-kyung.

01:13:35.244 --> 01:13:36.703
Whatever you look like,

01:13:36.787 --> 01:13:39.957
with or without makeup,
you're always you, Ju-kyung.

01:13:41.333 --> 01:13:44.878
Run away as far as you can and hide.

01:13:44.962 --> 01:13:48.382
Don't you worry. I'll get you transferred
to somewhere no one knows you.

01:13:49.800 --> 01:13:54.680
Subtitle translation by: Sun-young Ahn
